# Never ship secrets, keys, or databases in an image layer (any depth).
**/.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/secrets*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
# Local clutter
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/.coverage
**/node_modules
**/.cursor
# Content comes from MyRoad-content at build time, not from a local copy.
packages/core/content
docs
